	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Postquam has absolvi, refert mihi d. <persName ref="p1059">Christophorus</persName><note type="misc"><persName ref="p1059">Christopher Fabri</persName></note>, minister <placeName ref="l339">Neocomensis</placeName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cum suo principe huc venit et his diebus<note type="misc">vorn im Brief vom 31. Dez. 1561</note>, dum hic est princeps, con<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>cionaturus est hic, <placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> theologos <placeName ref="l2686">Sorbonicos</placeName> disputationem habuisse, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>an liceat regi parere haeretico, item an non liceat pastoribus monere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>subditos, ut contra talem regem insurgant atque ipsum regno pellant [Affaire Tanquerel Nov. 1561.]</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Re<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>x ubi haec cognovit, septem illorum theologorum in vincula coniecit; iudi<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>catum super illis in parlamento, adiudicati sunt, ut publice palinodiam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>canant, deum et regem pro venia precentur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hoc dum illi facere nolunt, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in carceribus adhuc detinentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interea decretum, ut in <placeName ref="l2686">Sorbona</placeName> ad <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>triennium usque nihil amplius disputetur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Refert item heri ex <placeName ref="l301">Lug<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>duno</placeName> venisse nobilem quendam cordatum virum, qui testetur per totam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> templa fidelibus esse concessa et <placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> amplissimas et nu<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>merosissimas haberi congregationes.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Haec quoniam nova sunt, reliquis adii<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cere volui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Communicabis ista fratri quoque meo <persName ref="p1453">[Wolfgang Haller]</persName>, cui alias nescio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>an nunc scribere possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
